Cell["\<\
This notebook is a compact laboratory for the field update and the small \
exact graph-of-graphs models.  It favors executable cells, pictures, and one \
interactive experiment; proofs and asymptotic arguments remain in the LaTeX \
manuscript.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "GoGNotebook" -> <|"Companion" -> True, "ID" -> "GoGCompanionIntro"|>|>,
