Cell["\<\
The bundled complete models have N=2,4,6.  Rule A keeps all 3N resolution \
slots and their multiplicities.  Fixed-clock Rule B gives one tick to each \
distinct nonself target and converts unused ticks into holding probability.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "GoGNotebook" -> <|"Companion" -> True, "ID" -> "GoGClockText"|>|>,
 LineSpacing->{1.15, 2},
