Cell["\<\
Exact N=4 transition matrices shown as heat maps.  Rule A is not symmetric; \
fixed-clock Rule B is symmetric and has the uniform class law.\
\>", "Caption",
 ShowCellBracket->False,
 CellMargins->{{72, 72}, {2, 18}},
 TaggingRules-><|
