Cell["\<\
This companion deliberately omits theorem and proof text.  The full \
mathematical source is whitehead-field-dynamics.tex; the annotated cell \
transcript is whitehead-field-dynamics-computational-notes.tex; and \
docs/notebook.rst records the build and verification boundary.  The bundled \
quotient resource does not contain concrete carrier-edge choices or \
settlement maps, so it does not by itself define a pathwise transported-field \
cocycle.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "GoGNotebook" -> <|"Companion" -> True, "ID" -> "GoGScopeText"|>|>,
 LineSpacing->{1.15, 2},
 FontSize->12,
 FontSlant->Plain,
 CellTags->{
  "GoGCompanion", 
   "GoGScopeText"},ExpressionUUID->"d5156a8d-281f-2a40-813e-f1dd60f44849"]
